TITLE:: RCGuard
summary:: Failure isolation helpers
categories:: Libraries>reCurrent
related:: Classes/RCLog

DESCRIPTION::
Every user callback the library invokes goes through link::#*call::, so an error in one of them is reported once (rate-limited, tagged) and replaced by a fallback value instead of killing the caller.

CLASSMETHODS::
METHOD:: call
argument:: tag
argument:: fallback
Value (or function) returned on error.
argument:: func
METHOD:: callWithError
METHOD:: wrap
A Function whose every call is guarded.
METHOD:: strict
When true, errors are rethrown (tests, development).
METHOD:: finite
Replace NaN / inf (recursively) by a fallback, with a warning.
METHOD:: isFinite
METHOD:: boundedLoop
A while loop with an iteration cap.
